WEBVTT

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.292
Akari...

00:00:18.292 --> 00:00:21.167
This is your first operation.

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:25.583
Bring down your own enemy.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.583
Here's the operation code name.

00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:31.667
I got it from the initials
of our names, Aria and Akari.

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:34.167
It's "AA."

00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:38.500
I'll give you one last chance.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.958
Come join I-U, Akari.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.708
You can become strong...

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:45.208
Stronger than Aria Kanzaki.

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:48.208
I'll never become... yours!

00:00:53.875 --> 00:00:58.250
In the language of flowers,
oleander means "dangerous love."

00:01:02.375 --> 00:01:04.042
Let's play.

00:02:42.542 --> 00:02:48.333
I wonder which happens first--your
surrender or your friends' annihilation.

00:02:50.292 --> 00:02:53.417
It's easier for me to fight tonight
than it was two years ago...

00:02:56.958 --> 00:03:00.208
...since tonight's rules allow me to kill everyone.

00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:03.083
Calm down.

00:03:03.083 --> 00:03:07.083
That's right! Remember Aria's lessons!

00:03:07.083 --> 00:03:09.917
You should pay more attention
to your surroundings.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.625
Nanowires...!

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:33.042
That's right. If you weren't even
able to detect something like this...

00:03:33.042 --> 00:03:34.792
...it would've been quite disappointing.

00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:44.458
Hold it!

00:03:44.458 --> 00:03:52.375
Let's get rid of those in our way
first so that we can have a long talk.

00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:55.333
Kyochikutou escaped and is headed
towards the north side of the hotel!

00:03:55.333 --> 00:03:57.375
She's using wires as her foothold!

00:03:57.375 --> 00:04:01.250
Copy that! Miss Fuma is positioned in that area!

00:04:15.042 --> 00:04:17.875
That angle was a little tough to shoot.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:25.000
My humble, low-ranking
ninja self is your opponent.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.583
Let me hear your wish.

00:04:27.583 --> 00:04:30.875
How do you want to die?

00:04:30.875 --> 00:04:34.917
I plan to die a peaceful
death on the tatami mat!

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:37.208
Oh?

00:04:39.708 --> 00:04:41.125
Poison gas?

00:04:42.292 --> 00:04:44.167
How careless, Kyochikutou!

00:04:44.167 --> 00:04:47.292
My mask can block poison!

00:04:58.042 --> 00:05:00.875
You thought I'd poison you through breathing?

00:05:01.667 --> 00:05:05.167
I wouldn't do something boring like that.

00:05:05.167 --> 00:05:07.792
I can't have fun that way, can I?

00:05:12.417 --> 00:05:14.583
H-How regrettable...

00:05:15.167 --> 00:05:18.458
That's a cloud made
by combining acid and poison.

00:05:18.458 --> 00:05:23.375
It doesn't melt human bodies,
but the poison enters through the skin.

00:05:23.375 --> 00:05:24.417
Oh?

00:05:29.708 --> 00:05:32.958
You've had training in poison resistance, huh?

00:05:32.958 --> 00:05:35.958
But you can't go on any longer, can't you?

00:05:42.708 --> 00:05:47.583
Don't! In our clan,
when a female ninja's face is seen,

00:05:47.583 --> 00:05:49.167
it's as if her naked body is seen!

00:05:49.167 --> 00:05:51.667
I know. That's why I want to see it.

00:05:55.375 --> 00:05:59.750
Now... how do you feel?
I'm looking at your face.

00:06:12.208 --> 00:06:15.667
As a bonus, that poison
was a relaxant. See you.

00:06:21.667 --> 00:06:24.708
Miss Fuma is down!

00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:26.042
Hina is?!

00:06:26.042 --> 00:06:28.833
But she succeeded in
setting a transmitter on her.

00:06:28.833 --> 00:06:32.292
Kyochikutou is headed towards the station!

00:06:32.292 --> 00:06:36.042
It seems that she uses poison gas, too.

00:06:36.042 --> 00:06:41.042
In order to avoid the risk of citizens being
harmed, please lure her to a wide-open area.

00:06:41.042 --> 00:06:42.625
Got it.

00:06:42.625 --> 00:06:43.958
Let's go.

00:06:46.542 --> 00:06:48.542
Which direction is Kyochikutou headed?

00:06:48.542 --> 00:06:54.000
From your location,
she's headed west-northwest.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:59.792
I see. So we'll avoid fighting in
crowded areas and narrow the encirclement?

00:06:59.792 --> 00:07:04.083
Right. Please block our enemy's escape that way.

00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:07.250
I'll go rescue Miss Fuma.

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:11.583
Kyochikutou really seems a formidable enemy.

00:07:11.583 --> 00:07:13.750
Miss Urara, please give us our orders.

00:07:16.583 --> 00:07:19.917
You two go help Kirin Shima.

00:07:19.917 --> 00:07:20.750
Miss Urara!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.375
Why such orders?!

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:24.750
I'm sure she needs some help.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.542
I'll be able to handle Kyochikutou by myself.

00:07:28.542 --> 00:07:29.708
What?!

00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:32.458
Please let us come with you!

00:07:32.458 --> 00:07:34.792
You don't get it, do you?

00:07:34.792 --> 00:07:38.458
I want to do it by myself
so that I can take all the credit.

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:40.042
But...

00:07:40.042 --> 00:07:42.208
Remember what Aria said?

00:07:42.208 --> 00:07:44.333
I-U, the organization
that Kyochikutou belongs to,

00:07:44.333 --> 00:07:48.167
is a shadowy international crime organization.

00:07:48.167 --> 00:07:51.125
This is a task beyond your abilities.

00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:53.458
Miss Urara, are you possibly...

00:07:53.458 --> 00:07:56.292
...trying to keep us out of danger?

00:07:57.667 --> 00:08:01.250
What're you saying?! It's not like that!

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.833
Miss Urara!

00:08:03.833 --> 00:08:06.917
Anyway, this is a task for A-rank <i>butei</i>!

00:08:06.917 --> 00:08:09.083
You two stay back!

00:08:37.375 --> 00:08:39.792
Kyochikutou changed her route!

00:08:39.792 --> 00:08:42.083
She's headed towards
the warehouse district in the bayside.

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:44.333
I'll continue to pursue her.

00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:45.708
Copy that!

00:08:50.542 --> 00:08:52.542
Where's Kyochikutou?

00:08:52.542 --> 00:08:54.792
300 meters ahead of your location.

00:08:54.792 --> 00:08:58.042
Looks like she's hiding by the third warehouse.

00:08:58.042 --> 00:09:02.333
Copy that. Until Akari and the others come,
I'll somehow hold her back here.

00:09:08.875 --> 00:09:10.375
She's not here?

00:09:16.208 --> 00:09:19.042
No scorpion would run away from ants.

00:09:21.792 --> 00:09:23.833
When did she...?

00:09:23.833 --> 00:09:27.250
You actually thought I wouldn't
notice such a petty transmitter?

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:37.583
You have a nice body which
can be easily poisoned, and yet...

00:09:37.583 --> 00:09:39.750
...you show your skin like that...

00:09:41.917 --> 00:09:44.708
Wh-What's going on?

00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:52.750
How do you feel? Doesn't it
tingle so much that it feels good?

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:55.583
Oh, you look cute.

00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:57.750
Stay like that for a while...

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.583
...and writhe.

00:10:07.083 --> 00:10:09.958
Raika...! Raika!

00:10:16.375 --> 00:10:19.083
I came to interfere again.

00:10:19.083 --> 00:10:21.292
What a beautiful friendship.

00:10:21.292 --> 00:10:24.375
I like that sort of thing.

00:10:24.375 --> 00:10:26.250
Friendship?

00:10:27.583 --> 00:10:33.125
The word friendship isn't
enough to describe my feelings!

00:10:35.625 --> 00:10:37.042
Hold it!

00:10:48.667 --> 00:10:53.375
Something is wrong... I don't
remember this area being this big.

00:11:04.167 --> 00:11:05.583
This is...

00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:12.292
Shoot! Poison gas!

00:11:12.292 --> 00:11:13.875
Hallucinogenic drug...?

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:18.708
Then I'll just shoot them all down...!

00:11:31.042 --> 00:11:35.125
This is... where I was earlier.

00:11:35.125 --> 00:11:38.583
Does it mean that I didn't
even move even a step?

00:11:38.583 --> 00:11:41.500
Looks like you were able to have a fun dream.

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:51.458
It's me.

00:11:51.458 --> 00:11:52.875
Miss Urara!

00:11:52.875 --> 00:11:56.042
I let... my guard down...

00:11:56.792 --> 00:11:58.375
Miss Urara! Hang in there!

00:11:58.375 --> 00:12:00.792
Miss Urara!

00:12:00.792 --> 00:12:02.292
Akari...

00:12:02.292 --> 00:12:07.042
Can you... hear me...?

00:12:07.042 --> 00:12:11.708
Kyochikutou is headed... towards the bridge.

00:12:11.708 --> 00:12:15.583
She knows about the transmitter.

00:12:15.583 --> 00:12:17.542
Be careful.

00:12:17.542 --> 00:12:20.042
Got it. Thank you!

00:12:20.042 --> 00:12:21.333
Let's hurry!

00:12:39.375 --> 00:12:42.292
No news on Kyochikutou's arrest...

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.917
Akari...

00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:48.500
Reki!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.667
What's the matter?

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:54.667
I have a message for you
from Ms. Takamagahara.

00:12:54.667 --> 00:12:57.083
What is it? Is it something urgent?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.417
What?!

00:13:04.917 --> 00:13:06.917
"Metropolitan Police Department"

00:13:12.917 --> 00:13:14.417
"Road closed due to accident"

00:13:18.958 --> 00:13:21.125
The road is closed.

00:13:21.125 --> 00:13:26.125
A pileup occurred and cars
cannot enter the bridge right now.

00:13:26.125 --> 00:13:28.958
Is it possible this was
also caused by Kyochikutou?

00:13:28.958 --> 00:13:34.292
Yes. I think she created
a place to fight Miss Mamiya.

00:13:34.292 --> 00:13:37.625
As it turned out, we were able
to lure her to a wide-open area,

00:13:37.625 --> 00:13:40.958
but in return, she's been
crushing us one by one.

00:13:40.958 --> 00:13:43.458
Please work together to fight her.

00:13:43.458 --> 00:13:46.958
Akari... Be careful of
the poison in her fingernails.

00:13:46.958 --> 00:13:48.625
When you fight, keep a distance from her.

00:13:48.625 --> 00:13:51.667
Raika! You shouldn't move yet!

00:13:55.375 --> 00:13:59.667
The police haven't realized yet that
the accident was caused by Kyochikutou.

00:13:59.667 --> 00:14:04.833
Looks like it'll take a while
before things are arranged.

00:14:04.833 --> 00:14:06.917
Let's go.

00:14:06.917 --> 00:14:11.000
Crimes and incidents
don't wait for <i>butei </i>to be ready.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.083
I'll make a surprise attack from below.

00:14:13.083 --> 00:14:16.500
Until then, please keep
our enemy's attention on you.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.792
Got it.

00:14:29.167 --> 00:14:30.958
I want you to show your appreciation,

00:14:30.958 --> 00:14:36.042
since I created a stage in
a place like this for our showdown.

00:14:36.042 --> 00:14:37.625
This isn't funny!

00:14:39.708 --> 00:14:41.417
I'm a deadly poison,

00:14:41.417 --> 00:14:44.083
and you aren't good enough to purify me.

00:14:49.458 --> 00:14:52.667
I have to keep her attention on me.

00:14:53.708 --> 00:14:58.208
That suitcase... Are you
trying to flee or something?

00:14:58.208 --> 00:15:00.125
Oh, this?

00:15:00.125 --> 00:15:03.167
My friends in I-U forced it on me.

00:15:03.167 --> 00:15:06.250
I told them that I didn't want it
because I'm not strong enough to use it,

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:08.750
but they said it was recoilless.

00:15:12.292 --> 00:15:16.167
Well, maybe it wasn't
a bad idea to bring it with me.

00:15:24.083 --> 00:15:27.417
It's rude of you to keep your
distance from me so blatantly.

00:15:29.208 --> 00:15:30.917
A Gatling gun...

00:15:35.458 --> 00:15:36.875
Akari!

00:15:49.042 --> 00:15:52.917
Sh... Shino...?

00:15:52.917 --> 00:15:55.458
You protected me...

00:15:56.875 --> 00:16:00.917
Our school uniform is bulletproof,
but that was just...

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:05.250
Akari...

00:16:05.250 --> 00:16:06.625
Shino!

00:16:06.625 --> 00:16:11.875
Stay the way you are, as a Butei High student...

00:16:11.875 --> 00:16:17.625
Don't give up on being a <i>butei</i>.

00:16:17.625 --> 00:16:20.458
Shi... no...

00:16:22.292 --> 00:16:26.125
Shino!

00:16:26.125 --> 00:16:27.917
Oh, how disappointing.

00:16:27.917 --> 00:16:32.125
I did want to see her suffer
from being poisoned.

00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:43.417
Kyochikutou...

00:16:53.708 --> 00:16:56.000
What're you doing?

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.667
Takamakuri.

00:17:01.833 --> 00:17:04.375
Oh, I see.

00:17:04.375 --> 00:17:09.292
So your hands are
poisonous just like mine, huh?

00:17:09.292 --> 00:17:12.083
I overlooked it when the hint
was right in front of me.

00:17:12.083 --> 00:17:15.167
So you have it spread on your hand...

00:17:15.167 --> 00:17:18.875
Show me... that Mamiya Technique.

00:17:21.208 --> 00:17:23.333
Miss Urara...

00:17:23.333 --> 00:17:26.333
Hino... this is Fuma's antidote.

00:17:26.333 --> 00:17:30.792
Miss Mamiya! No! <i>Butei </i>cannot kill!

00:17:30.792 --> 00:17:35.083
Miss Mamiya! Are you listening?!

00:17:35.083 --> 00:17:36.792
Don't worry.

00:17:36.792 --> 00:17:39.375
Believe in Akari.

00:17:42.833 --> 00:17:45.000
A Mamiya technique that is described as follows:

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:48.625
"Slipping through a thousand arrows,
death is caused by one touch,

00:17:48.625 --> 00:17:51.208
and it doesn't leave any scratches on the body."

00:17:53.292 --> 00:17:55.042
Takamakuri...

00:17:57.625 --> 00:18:00.208
A poison technique that can
be used in mid-range combat...

00:18:00.208 --> 00:18:02.458
Just what kind of poison is it?

00:18:02.458 --> 00:18:06.167
My success rate for Takamakuri is one in three.

00:18:06.167 --> 00:18:09.375
If I fail, she might kill me.

00:18:09.375 --> 00:18:12.375
Even so...!

00:18:12.375 --> 00:18:15.250
If the battle had been real,
you would've been dead.

00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:16.375
"5. There's no battle in which it's okay to die."
"6. <i>Butei </i>should always be on guard."

00:18:19.458 --> 00:18:23.417
That's right... I almost
forgot something important.

00:18:23.417 --> 00:18:26.125
Calm down... I'm a <i>butei</i>.

00:18:26.125 --> 00:18:30.417
I'm here to arrest
the perpetrator in front of me.

00:18:30.417 --> 00:18:32.208
What's wrong?

00:18:32.208 --> 00:18:34.792
Hurry up and show me Takamakuri.

00:18:37.417 --> 00:18:40.875
If you don't come at me, then I'll release...

00:18:42.458 --> 00:18:43.958
...the thousand arrows!

00:18:50.917 --> 00:18:52.083
Huh?

00:18:52.833 --> 00:18:55.833
No flashes of light... I failed.

00:18:59.708 --> 00:19:02.250
What did you just do?

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:06.458
Takamakuri isn't a poison.

00:19:06.458 --> 00:19:09.292
Human bodies have
hidden oscillations called pulses,

00:19:09.292 --> 00:19:11.125
caused by small electric currents.

00:19:11.125 --> 00:19:13.125
Takamakuri is a technique
whereby you amplify those oscillations

00:19:13.125 --> 00:19:15.083
and throw them at your opponent

00:19:15.083 --> 00:19:18.500
by using the gyro effect
created by rotating your body.

00:19:20.417 --> 00:19:24.250
The feeling I had when Mom
taught it to me is coming back.

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:26.167
I won't fail this time.

00:19:27.042 --> 00:19:28.792
You can't fool me.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.458
Don't be hasty.
The right moment will definitely come.

00:19:43.375 --> 00:19:45.458
She ran out of bullets!

00:19:45.458 --> 00:19:49.000
<i>Butei </i>should always be on guard.

00:19:52.167 --> 00:19:54.292
She's calmer than I thought.

00:19:54.292 --> 00:19:56.167
So it really was a trap.

00:19:56.167 --> 00:19:59.750
Lessons from Aria are protecting me!

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:05.292
If Takamakuri isn't a poison,
I don't need to be here.

00:20:05.292 --> 00:20:07.375
I wonder what I should do...

00:20:26.833 --> 00:20:30.542
So... it really wasn't a poison...

00:20:41.500 --> 00:20:42.583
Shino!

00:20:42.583 --> 00:20:43.417
Don't worry.

00:20:43.417 --> 00:20:45.292
Her wounds are shallow.

00:20:45.292 --> 00:20:47.583
Seems like the ammunition was weak,

00:20:47.583 --> 00:20:52.167
so all the bullets that directly hit her
were blocked by the bulletproof school uniform.

00:20:52.167 --> 00:20:57.250
Raika and the others are also
recovering using Miss Fuma's antidotes.

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:00.208
I think they'll get better soon.

00:21:00.208 --> 00:21:03.583
Good... Glad to hear that.

00:21:03.583 --> 00:21:05.458
You guys...

00:21:05.458 --> 00:21:07.625
...will be in trouble.

00:21:07.625 --> 00:21:08.583
What?

00:21:08.583 --> 00:21:10.958
You shouldn't be such a sore loser!

00:21:10.958 --> 00:21:12.833
I'm not being a sore loser.

00:21:12.833 --> 00:21:16.417
You should've just obeyed me without fighting.

00:21:19.917 --> 00:21:21.917
I wonder what she meant...

00:21:21.917 --> 00:21:24.042
You shouldn't worry about it.

00:21:24.042 --> 00:21:26.458
Now, let's go see Raika and the others!

00:21:26.458 --> 00:21:28.458
Akari!

00:21:28.458 --> 00:21:32.083
Aria! You came?!

00:21:32.083 --> 00:21:35.500
Reki delivered some information from school.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:37.458
It's still unconfirmed,

00:21:37.458 --> 00:21:41.458
but it seems that Kyochikutou
isn't the only one who infiltrated.

00:21:41.458 --> 00:21:44.250
There's another I-U member out there.

00:21:52.167 --> 00:21:55.625
I was told that you bullied my little sister.

00:21:55.625 --> 00:21:56.708
Little sister?

00:21:56.708 --> 00:21:57.292
"Potato"

00:21:57.292 --> 00:22:01.542
Kyochikutou is my precious little sister.

00:22:01.542 --> 00:22:03.500
And...

00:22:07.292 --> 00:22:08.083
"Episode 11: Showdown"

00:22:08.083 --> 00:22:10.500
"Episode 11: Showdown"
...I am Suimitsutou!

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:45.792
The time I spent together with you...

00:23:47.333 --> 00:23:49.167
...was pretty fun.

00:23:50.292 --> 00:23:52.167
Goodbye, Akari.

00:23:52.167 --> 00:23:53.958
Become a good <i>butei</i>.

00:23:55.333 --> 00:23:56.160
"Episode 12 : A Pair of As"
